{"about_the_game":"Blue Fish Yokohama is a relaxing tile-based puzzle game where all the ramen is deliciously eaten by our protagonist... a fish!?!!?!?!!<br><br><i>What's on the menu?</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716500/extras/a4cc9cd60fae42cc3d560feaab905da3.avif?t=1754312197\" width=425 height=103 /></span><br>1. Cheese ramen is sticky and fat so you don't jump so far. <br>2. Miso ramen has that umami boost. <br>3. Spicy hot tantanmen will blow you away. <br>4. Mizu Yokan is your bouncy dessert. <br><br><strong>Game Features</strong><br>+ Simple controls that you will pick up instantly<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716500/extras/8b2537998d51e5e873ae32226bf78ae7.poster.avif?t=1754312197\" width=600 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716500/extras/8b2537998d51e5e873ae32226bf78ae7.webm?t=1754312197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716500/extras/8b2537998d51e5e873ae32226bf78ae7.mp4?t=1754312197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>+ Discover new and exciting game mechanics as the levels progress.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716500/extras/57e53571f5e0e7037dbf0cfa6444e5e9.poster.avif?t=1754312197\" width=600 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716500/extras/57e53571f5e0e7037dbf0cfa6444e5e9.webm?t=1754312197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716500/extras/57e53571f5e0e7037dbf0cfa6444e5e9.mp4?t=1754312197\" type=\"vide